   "html": "<p>We designed an exclusive mailer to amplify the Disney+ Throwback Campaign that functioned as a cultural time capsule for mid-90s and early 2000s identity. Rooted in the idea that lockers were our first form of self-expression, each was personalized based on the recipients “Throwback Mood” and jam packed with character-inspired artifacts and era-specific gems.</p>\n<p>Our audience included creators, press, execs, and internal stakeholders - each receiving a version designed to spark joy, inspire unboxings, and reignite their love for some classic Disney programming. We facilitated all creator communications and shipping logistics, resulting in massive shareability - proving that even digital natives will go analog when the packaging hits home.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "MAILER CONTENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>To capture the carefree spirit of summer, each mailer included a retro-inspired photo kit with an instant camera, a nostalgic Disney+ sticker sheet, and a branded zip case for easy transport. Alongside this, recipients received a custom pin set and journaling kit, and a personalized retro-style CD player with headphones loaded with authentic era CDs curated to each recipient’s summer mood. Rounding out the package was a campaign-branded Igloo cooler backpack and a standout denim varsity jacket, custom-embroidered and patched with key IP and campaign icons to embody the bold, personalized style of the era.</p>"
    },
