  {
   "title": "LOCKER CUSTOMIZATION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>While the base locker design stayed consistent, each mailer was uniquely tailored to the recipient’s chosen Summer Throwback mood, determined through an intake survey with four distinct options. Each locker was thoughtfully personalized with custom-printed Polaroids, a name plaque, and decorative magnets including a musical magnet that played a special song when opened, making every mailer a unique celebration of the recipient’s vibe.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Expressive kits highlighted music lovers featuring Hannah Montana and High School Musical. Cozy kits catered to nostalgia seekers featuring mementos from Gilmore Girls and Full House. Glam kits channeled Y2K fashion with nods to Lizzie McGuire and That’s So Raven, while Spontaneous kits highlighted Kim Possible and Phineas and Ferb.</p>"
    },
